# Rhys, the Evermore's "{W}, {T}: Remove any number of counters from target creature you control" takes as many as the
# creature has, however many (CR 122.1, 608.2d): no fewer counters are offered than are there. Turn 1: Black Lotuses
# pay for Doubling Season. Turn 3: Ulamog, the Defiler's cast trigger exiles the top half of Bot2's library with Emrakul,
# the Aeons Torn among it (mana value 15), so Ulamog enters with 15 +1/+1 counters, doubled to 30. Bristly Bill doubles
# them on turns 13 and 15, each doubling doubled again: 90, then 270. Turn 19: Rhys removes all 270, and Ulamog is a 7/7.

